    "type": "trend",
    "page": 13,
    "quote": "The most related work LogTrans and Reformer shows acceptable results. The LSTMa model is not amenable for the long sequence prediction task. The ARIMA and DeepAR can capture the long trend of the long sequences. And the Prophet detects the changing point and fits it with a smooth curve better than the ARIMA and DeepAR. Our proposed model Informer and Informer\u2020 show significantly better results than above methods.",
    "headline": false
